{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFNormalizer\/normalize(_:)"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a copy of the provided sequence normalized to canonical form,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"along with an array describing each change applied."}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorsmf\/smfnormalizer\/normalize(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"normalize","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sequence","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFSequence","text":"SMFSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorSMF11SMFSequenceV"},{"text":") -> (","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFSequence","text":"SMFSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorSMF11SMFSequenceV"},{"text":", [","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFNormalizer\/Change","text":"Change","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorSMF13SMFNormalizerV6ChangeO"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"sequence","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The sequence to normalize."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tuple of a new "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFSequence","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFSequence\/isNormalized","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":", and an array of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFNormalizer\/Change","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" values describing each normalization applied."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Normalization is idempotent: calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"normalize(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" on an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already-normalized sequence returns it immediately with an empty"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes array."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Canonical form requires each track to have exactly one End-of-Track"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"meta-event, as the final event, at a tick greater than or equal to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every other event in the track. Each track is mechanically and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data-preservingly brought into this form: all End-of-Track events are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"removed, then a single End-of-Track is appended at the maximum"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remaining event tick (or tick zero if the track is otherwise empty)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No musical events are ever dropped."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Canonical form also requires a format-0 sequence to have exactly one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"track. A format-0 sequence with more than one track is reinterpreted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as format 1, which has no such restriction."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Canonical form also requires that, within a track, a sequence-number"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"meta-event appear at time zero, and that, in a format-1 sequence with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"more than one track, tempo and time-signature meta-events appear only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the first track. A misplaced sequence-number event has its time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reset to zero; a misplaced tempo or time-signature event is moved to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"track 0 at its original tick."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This clears every "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFValidator\/Issue","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" case that has a mechanical"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fix, so a normalized sequence has no validation issues arising from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them. Issues that require a judgment call (such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFValidator\/Issue\/unencodableText(trackIndex:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") are left to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFValidator","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"normalize"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorSMF11SMFSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SMFSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorSMF11SMFSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SMFSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":", ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorSMF13SMFNormalizerV6ChangeO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Change"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}],"extendedModule":"IvorSMF","externalID":"s:7IvorSMF13SMFNormalizerV9normalizeyAA11SMFSequenceV_SayAC6ChangeOGtAFF","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"IvorSMF"}],"title":"normalize(_:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF","doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFNormalizer"]]},"references":{"doc://IvorSMF/documentation/IvorSMF/SMFValidator":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivorsmf\/smfvalidator","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"SMFValidator","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A type that validates an SMF sequence against the Standard MIDI Files","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specification.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SMFValidator","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFValidator","title":"SMFValidator"},"doc://IvorSMF/documentation/IvorSMF/SMFValidator/Issue/unencodableText(trackIndex:)":{"title":"SMFValidator.Issue.unencodableText(trackIndex:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"unencodableText"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"trackIndex"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A meta-event in this track carries text with one or more characters","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that cannot be encoded as single-byte SMF text.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFValidator\/Issue\/unencodableText(trackIndex:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivorsmf\/smfvalidator\/issue\/unencodabletext(trackindex:)"},"doc://IvorSMF/documentation/IvorSMF/SMFNormalizer/normalize(_:)":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivorsmf\/smfnormalizer\/normalize(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"normalize","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorSMF11SMFSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SMFSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorSMF11SMFSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SMFSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":", ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorSMF13SMFNormalizerV6ChangeO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Change"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a copy of the provided sequence normalized to canonical form,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"along with an array describing each change applied.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFNormalizer\/normalize(_:)","title":"normalize(_:)"},"doc://IvorSMF/documentation/IvorSMF/SMFSequence/isNormalized":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFSequence\/isNormalized","url":"\/documentation\/ivorsmf\/smfsequence\/isnormalized","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"isNormalized","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether this sequence has been normalized"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"via "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorSMF\/documentation\/IvorSMF\/SMFNormalizer\/normalize(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isNormalized"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://IvorSMF/documentation/IvorSMF/SMFNormalizer/Change":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivorsmf\/smfnormalizer\/change","fragmen